  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_royal/banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"511\" height=\"134\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>專為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantasys-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fantasy's Furniture</strong></a> 設計的<strong>皇家</strong>家具套裝，新增具備完整功能的家具，包括但不限於：<strong>箱子</strong>、<strong>抽屜</strong>、<strong>床</strong>、<strong>座椅</strong>等！</p>\n<p>此套裝的設計大量靈感源自典型的<strong>巴洛克</strong>與<strong>皇室</strong>風格家具，全部由<strong>金塊</strong>與<strong>可染色羊毛</strong>打造！</p>\n<h3>配方</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>若要製作<strong>皇家磚塊</strong>/<strong>皇家羊毛</strong>，必須放入<strong>#minecraft:stone_crafting_materials</strong>/<strong>#minecraft:wool</strong>。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_royal/stonecutter_bricks.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_royal/stonecutter_wool.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>若要製作<strong>皇家</strong>家具方塊，必須將<strong>#fantasyfurniture:binding_agent</strong>、<strong>皇家磚塊</strong>與<strong>皇家羊毛</strong>放入<strong>Furniture Station</strong> 中。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/minecraft/fantasyfurniture_royal/furniture_station.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">歡迎加入我們的 <strong>Discord</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.apexmodder.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ApexStudios-Dev/.github/refs/heads/master/assets/third_party/discord_banner.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fapexstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f4d8198a-6c2a-4d86-8d74-1977589e8ef7.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
